.TH RECT_CENTER 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
rect_center \- The center point of r
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcollide.h\(dq
.BI "Vec2 rect_center(Rect r);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The center point of r. Aim at the middle of a target, spawn particles from the middle of a box.
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the center as a Vec2.
.SH MODULE
math (src/engine/math/collide.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rect_centered (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
